{"id":"n61373-1-10","stage":4,"title":"사시사철 · 一年四季","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61373-1-10-1","ko":"여기는 사시사철의 풍경이 늘 아름답네요.","zh":"这里的风景一年到头都十分美丽呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기는","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사시사철의","meaning":"一年四季","explanation":"사시사철：一年四季；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사시사철","audio":"/audio/f9054807a24a1925ab7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61373","senseId":"1","lemma":"사시사철","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"풍경이","meaning":"风景，风光，景色，景致","explanation":"풍경：风景，风光，景色，景致；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"풍경","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72392","senseId":"1","lemma":"풍경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늘","meaning":"总，老，老是，经常","explanation":"늘：总，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"늘","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40481","senseId":"1","lemma":"늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아름답네요.","meaning":"美丽，漂亮","explanation":"아름답다：美丽，漂亮；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"f9054807a24a1925","term":"사시사철","zh":"一年四季","audio":"/audio/f9054807a24a1925ab7b.mp3","entryId":"61373","definition":"春夏秋冬四个季节的时间。","pronunciation":["사ː시사ː철"]},{"id":"64d560d21687616f","term":"풍경","zh":"风景，风光，景色，景致","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3","entryId":"72392","definition":"大自然或某一地区的美景。","pronunciation":["풍경"]},{"id":"96a6023ce9edabaa","term":"늘","zh":"总，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3","entryId":"40481","definition":"无论什么时候都没变化，总是。","pronunciation":["늘"]},{"id":"b39be518859c28e0","term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽，漂亮","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3","entryId":"71290","definition":"对象、嗓音或颜色等令眼睛和耳朵都感到愉快和满足。","pronunciation":["아름답따"]}],"audio":"/audio/74802b49bbd3d38cad4e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61373-1-10-2","ko":"그래서 일 년 내내 관광객들이 끊이지 않습니다.","zh":"正因如此，全年都有络绎不绝的游客前来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"日","explanation":"일：日","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62598","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내내","meaning":"始终，一直","explanation":"내내：始终，一直","readings":[{"term":"내내","audio":"/audio/c4bb20b6c91a2fcfba30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60627","senseId":"1","lemma":"내내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"관광객들이","meaning":"游客，游人，观光客","explanation":"관광객：游客，游人，观光客；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"관광객","audio":"/audio/59dd0bd7778bf8332e3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22426","senseId":"1","lemma":"관광객","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끊이지","meaning":"断","explanation":"끊이다：断；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"끊이다","audio":"/audio/5e4e9636de136d171657.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37881","senseId":"1","lemma":"끊이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않습니다.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readi